/// Register16 marker trait — see `silica_device_actor_specification.md` §4.8.
///
/// Closed: its one implementation is `uint16`. The postfix marker `expr impl Register16 {}` on a
/// `peek` call or a `poke` value asserts that the access is 16 bits wide and that `expr` has type
/// `uint16`; it never establishes an implementation.

export trait Register16;
impl uint16;
